<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>方案保存SDK的原生入口与直接边界</title><style>body{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:24px;background:#101a29;color:#e3edf8;font:15px/1.7 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}a{color:#96d1ff}p{color:#b0c6dc}.notice{background:#1c2d43;border-left:4px solid #dfb16e;padding:15px}details{background:#17273c;padding:14px;border:1px solid #3f5671;margin:14px 0}summary{cursor:pointer}.unknown{border-color:#d299ac}pre{font:12px/1.6 Consolas,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#0b1524;padding:12px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style><a href="index.html">← 架构索引</a> · <a href="execution-storage.html#edge-S06">保存原生边界</a><h1>方案保存SDK的原生入口与直接边界</h1><p class="notice">五参数SDK声明→原导出IMVS_SaveSolution→handle门/初始化→0x180665BA0直接边界。5托管体、6个定界native函数848条指令；REA反编译工具不可用，原静态汇编独立保留。未执行SDK、未写.sol，落盘与格式仍未知。</p><p><a href="solution-save-native-boundary-audit.json">完整专题JSON</a> · <a href="solution-save-native-boundary-audit.native.json">原件范围与汇编</a> · <a href="solution-save-native-boundary-audit.cil.json">原托管CIL</a></p><nav><a href="#S01">S01</a> · <a href="#S02">S02</a> · <a href="#S03">S03</a> · <a href="#S04">S04</a> · <a href="#S05">S05</a> · <a href="#S06">S06</a> · <a href="#S07">S07</a> · <a href="#S08">S08</a> · <a href="#S09">S09</a> · <a href="#S10">S10</a> · <a href="#U01">U01</a> · <a href="#U02">U02</a></nav><details id="S01" class="source-confirmed"><summary>S01 · 既有保存入口/同步等待证据 → 新的原SDK身份与限定原生边界 · source-confirmed</summary><p>本专题复用execution-storage S01/S03/S04、solution-open-chain与main-menu-save-review已取托管入口，不把菜单或保存返回值再包装成新运行证据。新核原VM.PlatformSDKCS.dll SHA/MVID与PInvoke；所选x64 native SDK原件SHA、PE导出及函数体分别绑定，候选路径不代表实际进程已装载该文件。</p><p>待核：原运行模块路径/实例handle与具体用户保存事件未观察。</p><details><summary>Original SDK binding · 3–13</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/solution-save-native-boundary-audit.artifact-identities.json · original-managed-metadata · SHA 6f5d2e